# Audio Assets Directory

Place the following audio files here:

1. ambient_hum.mp3 - Low background hum (create with Audacity or download)
2. notification.mp3 - Message notification sound
3. glitch.mp3 - Static/glitch sound effect

You can generate these sounds using:
- Audacity (free): Generate tone/noise effects
- Online generators: https://www.zapsplat.com/
- Free sound libraries: https://freesound.org/

For quick testing, you can use any short MP3 files as placeholders.
